{"html":"<p><strong>흥덕점</strong> · 경기 용인시 기흥구 흥덕2로 85 우연프라자 201호</p><div class=\"kk-map-viewport\"><iframe class=\"kk-map-frame\" src=\"/assets/location-maps/embed/39t8txej9os-23f19c49984a70e4.htm\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"흥덕점 카카오 지도\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div><div class=\"kk-transit\"><div class=\"kk-transit-block\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><p>제공된 약도에 주변 지하철 정보가 없습니다.</p></div><div class=\"kk-transit-block\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ul><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">1</span><span>흥덕3단지.흥덕이마트후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">2</span><span>흥덕이마트</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">3</span><span>흥덕마을3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">4</span><span>흥덕마을3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">5</span><span>흥덕중심상업지구</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">6</span><span>흥덕중심상업지구</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">7</span><span>흥덕마을1단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kk-stop-number\">8</span><span>흥덕마을1단지</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kk-transit-block\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><div class=\"kk-bus-row\"><span class=\"kk-bus-type kk-bus-0109\">마을</span><ul><li>28-1</li><li>28-2</li><li>56-1</li><li>58-1</li></ul></div><div class=\"kk-bus-row\"><span class=\"kk-bus-type kk-bus-0106\">일반</span><ul><li>10-2</li><li>34</li><li>34-1</li><li>55</li><li>Y55</li><li>65</li></ul></div><div class=\"kk-bus-row\"><span class=\"kk-bus-type kk-bus-0110\">직행</span><ul><li>5006</li><li>5006(예약)</li><li>5007</li><li>P9243(출근)</li><li>P9243(퇴근)</li><li>Y9243</li></ul></div></div></div><p class=\"kk-source-note\">제공된 카카오 약도의 교통정보입니다. 실제 운행·정차는 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>"}